      "custom": {
        "name": "TL431",
        "prefix": "U",
        "pins": [
          {
            "number": "1",
            "name": "CATHODE",
            "side": "top"
          },
          {
            "number": "2",
            "name": "REF",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "3",
            "name": "ANODE",
            "side": "bottom"
          }
        ],
        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "TL431",
          "text": ".subckt TL431 cat ref an\n* reference input current about 2 uA\nRref ref an 1.25Meg\n* the cathode current rises steeply once REF is above 2.495 V (and the cathode is above ~1.2 V)\nBk cat an I=limit(200*(V(ref,an)-2.495),0,0.1)*step(V(cat,an)-1.2,0.2)\nRleak cat an 10Meg\n.ends TL431",
          "pins": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "3"
          ],
          "params": {},
          "limits": [
            "基準電圧は 2.495V で一定です。温度による変化・初期誤差(±0.5〜2%)は扱いません。",
            "カソード電流は 0〜100mA の範囲で制御します。最小動作電流(約 1mA)を下回ると実物は regulation しなくなりますが、このモデルは小さな電流でも regulation します。",
            "出力インピーダンスの周波数特性(AC)・位相の遅れは扱いません。大きな容量負荷での発振は再現しません。",
            "耐圧(36V)・最大電流を超えても壊れません。"
          ]
        },
        "ratings": {
          "v_max": 36.0,
          "i_max": 0.1,
          "p_max": 0.4,
          "rows": [
            {
              "name": "基準電圧",
              "value": "2.495V (代表)",
              "condition": "TL431, 25℃"
            },
            {
              "name": "最小カソード電流",
              "value": "1mA",
              "condition": "regulation に必要"
            },
            {
              "name": "REF 入力電流",
              "value": "2µA (代表)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "glyph": "shunt_reg"
      }
    },
